    "description": "What: a crew's light discipline at night (CE-4670, vehicle appearance VA-S3; docs/designs/vehicle-appearance/DESIGN_Vehicle_Appearance_State.md §6b). On basic-desert at 00:30 local, clear sky, two crewed T-72s idle 200 m apart on the terrain: 'Lit Tank' at (550, 250) under the default Normal discipline, 'Blacked-out Tank' at (550, 450) authored VehicleLights.Discipline Blackout. Judge: it is dark and both engines idle, so the Lit Tank's head and tail lights are on (its type's groups 0 and 1, OnMask 3) and the brake / convoy groups off; the Blacked-out Tank shows no light at all, ever. Fail: the lit one dark, or the blacked-out one lit. Red-proof: author the second tank Normal and it lights up.",
